# {{ project_name }}

## Compilation

### Directly with make

```bash
make
```

### With cmake

```bash
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
```

## Running the Executable

To run the executable, use the following command:

```bash
./build/bin/{{ executable_name }}
```

## Cleaning the environment

### Directly with make

```bash
make clean
```

### with cmake

```bash
cmake -E rm -rf build
```

### cleaning only compilation files

```bash
cd build
make clean
```
